0.21875 \nL 20.015625 33.296875 \nQ 19.046875 36.625 17.390625 36.625 \nQ 15.921875 36.625 14.25 35.109375 \nQ 12.59375 33.59375 11.921875 32.328125 \nQ 11.53125 32.328125 10.9375 33.109375 \nQ 10.359375 33.890625 10.359375 34.28125 \nQ 10.640625 35.9375 13.953125 39.203125 \nQ 17.28125 42.484375 20.3125 42.484375 \nz\n\" id=\"CrimsonText-Italic-120\"></path>\n     </defs>\n     <g transform=\"translate(262.592735 43.333872)scale(0.15 -0.15)\">\n      <use xlink:href=\"#CrimsonText-Italic-120\"></use>\n     </g>\n    </g>\n   </g>\n   <g id=\"line2d_1\">\n    <defs>\n     <path d=\"M 0 3 \nC 0.795609 3 1.55874 2.683901 2.12132 2.12132 \nC 2.683901 1.55874 3 0.795609 3 0 \nC 3 -0.795609 2.683901 -1.55874 2.12132 -2.12132 \nC 1.55874 -2.683901 0.795609 -3 0 -3 \nC -0.795609 -3 -1.55874 -2.683901 -2.12132 -2.12132 \nC -2.683901 -1.55874 -3 -0.795609 -3 0 \nC -3 0.795609 -2.683901 1.55874 -2.12132 2.12132 \nC -1.55874 2.683901 -0.795609 3 0 3 \nz\n\" id=\"m035df28401\" style=\"stroke:#000000;\"></path>\n    </defs>\n    <g clip-path=\"url(#pb5dec41813)\">\n     <use style=\"stroke:#000000;\" x=\"249.817156\" xlink:href=\"#m035df28401\" y=\"197.41185\"></use>\n     <use style=\"stroke:#000000;\" x=\"144.901629\" xlink:href=\"#m035df28401\" y=\"40.03856\"></use>\n    </g>\n   </g>\n   <g id=\"line2d_2\">\n    <path clip-path=\"url(#pb5dec41813)\" d=\"M 141.555125 35.018804 \nL 254.880714 205.007188 \nL 254.880714 205.007188 \n\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-linecap:square;stroke-width:2.3;\"></path>\n   </g>\n  </g>\n </g>\n <defs>\n  <clipPath id=\"pb5dec41813\">\n   <rect height=\"260.82\" width=\"271.206637\" x=\"7.2\" y=\"7.2\"></rect>\n  </clipPath>\n </defs>\n</svg>\n<div role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Long description for graph of a line\" class=\"sr-only\"><ul><li>The line slants sharply down from left to right.</li>\n<li>The line passes through the following points:<br>\n<ul>\n<li>(negative 6 comma 0)</li>\n<li>(0 comma negative 9)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul></div></figure></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The graph of line <math alttext=\"h\"><mi>h</mi>\n</math> is shown in the <em>xy</em>-plane. Line <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi>\n</math> (not shown) is defined by <math alttext=\"s x plus 48 y equals t\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mi>s</mi>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>48</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mi>t</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math>, where <math alttext=\"s\"><mi>s</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"t\"><mi>t</mi>\n</math> are constants. If line <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi>\n</math> is graphed in this <em>xy</em>-plane, the result is a graph of two linear equations. This system of two linear equations has no solution. Which of the following is <strong>NOT</strong> a possible value of <math alttext=\"t\"><mi>t</mi>\n</math>?</p>", "keys": ["95cc9dbd-db1c-471e-b2ef-bd2461482d99"], "answerOptions": [{"id": "95cc9dbd-db1c-471e-b2ef-bd2461482d99", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"negative 432\"><mrow>\n\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t<mn>432</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "ee6a8b47-799e-4d05-887e-577c9cc1fca2", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"negative 9\"><mrow>\n\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t<mn>9</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "687722a0-519e-436d-889a-7101bc025be2", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"72\"><mn>72</mn>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "df463922-53d7-4d91-8035-002ab5e1fbbc", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"288\"><mn>288</mn>\n</math></p>"}], "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is correct. It's given that if line <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi>\n</math> is graphed in the <em>xy</em>-plane with line <math alttext=\"h\"><mi>h</mi>\n</math>, the result is the graph of a system of two linear equations that has no solution. It follows that line <math alttext=\"h\"><mi>h</mi>\n</math> and line <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi>\n</math> don't intersect. This means that line <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi>\n</math> and line <math alttext=\"h\"><mi>h</mi>\n</math> have the same slope and different <em>y</em>-intercepts. The graph shows that the <em>y</em>-intercept of line <math alttext=\"h\"><mi>h</mi>\n</math> is&nbsp;<math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma negative 9 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. The <em>y</em>-coordinate of the <em>y</em>-intercept of line <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi>\n</math> is the value of <math alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi>\n</math> when <math alttext=\"x equals 0\"><mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>0</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math> in the equation defining line <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi>\n</math>. Substituting <math alttext=\"0\"><mn>0</mn>\n</math> for <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> in the equation <math alttext=\"s x plus 48 y equals t\"><mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mi>s</mi>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n<mo>+</mo>\n<mrow>\n<mn>48</mn>\n<mi>y</mi>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mi>t</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"s left parenthesis 0 right parenthesis plus 48 y equals t\"><mi>s</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>48</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math>, or <math alttext=\"48 y equals t\"><mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mn>48</mn>\n<mi>y</mi>\n</mrow>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mi>t</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Dividing both sides of this equation by <math alttext=\"48\"><mn>48</mn>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"y equals StartFraction t Over 48 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n<mi>y</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mrow>\n<mfrac>\n<mi>t</mi>\n<mn>48</mn>\n</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Therefore, the <em>y</em>-coordinate of the <em>y</em>-intercept of line <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"StartFraction t Over 48 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n<mfrac>\n<mi>t</mi>\n<mn>48</mn>\n</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</math>, so the <em>y</em>-intercept of line <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi>\n</math> is&nbsp;<math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma StartFraction t Over 48 EndFraction right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>t</mi><mn>48</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>. Since line <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi>\n</math> and line <math alttext=\"h\"><mi>h</mi>\n</math> have different <em>y</em>-intercepts, <math alttext=\"StartFraction t Over 48 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n<mfrac>\n<mi>t</mi>\n<mn>48</mn>\n</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</math> can't be equal to <math alttext=\"negative 9\"><mrow>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>9</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>. It follows that <math alttext=\"t\"><mi>t</mi>\n</math> can't be equal to&nbsp;<math alttext=\"minus 9 left parenthesis 48 right parenthesis\"><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mfenced><mn>48</mn></mfenced></math>, or <math alttext=\"negative 432\"><mrow>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>432</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Thus, <math alttext=\"negative 432\"><mrow>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>432</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math> isn't a possible value of <math alttext=\"t\"><mi>t</mi>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect. This isn't a possible value of the <em>y</em>-coordinate of the&nbsp;<em>y</em>-intercept of line <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi>\n</math>, but it is a possible value of <math alttext=\"t\"><mi>t</mi>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext=\"s\"><mi>s</mi>\n</math>, not a value of <math alttext=\"t\"><mi>t</mi>\n</math> that isn't possible.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect. If <math alttext=\"t equals 288\"><mrow>\n<mi>t</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>288</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>, then the <em>y</em>-intercept of line <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma StartFraction 288 Over 48 EndFraction right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>288</mn><mn>48</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>, or <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma 6 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, which is different from the <em>y</em>-intercept of line <math alttext=\"h\"><mi>h</mi>\n</math>, <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma negative 9 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. Therefore, <math alttext=\"288\"><mn>288</mn>\n</math> is a possible value of <math alttext=\"t\"><mi>t</mi>\n</math>.</p>", "externalid": "bf3d7c38-346b-4b31-8065-9d69383f8a13", "correct_answer": ["A"]}